WEBVTT

01:16:57.209 --> 01:16:58.709
-Is that him? Let's go!
-Hurry up! Go, go, go!

01:16:59.667 --> 01:17:01.167
I'm sure it was deliberate.

01:17:01.625 --> 01:17:04.417
We made a huge mistake
by letting Govardhan go that day.

01:17:04.750 --> 01:17:05.792
Otherwise…

01:17:06.584 --> 01:17:07.459
Let's go.
